## Control {{controlId}}: Escort visitors and monitor visitor activity.

**Implementation Status:** {{status}}

{{#if tenantName}}
{{tenantName}} requires all visitors to facilities where CUI systems are accessed to be escorted by authorized personnel at all times. Visitor access is logged, including name, organization, date/time of entry and departure, and purpose of visit. Visitors are not permitted unescorted access to areas where CUI is processed or stored.
{{/if}}

{{#if cisoEmail}}
The ISSO ({{cisoEmail}}) ensures visitor escort procedures are documented and communicated to all facility personnel. Visitor logs are reviewed periodically for compliance.
{{/if}}

{{#if cloudEnvironment}}
For the {{cloudEnvironment}} cloud environment, physical visitor access to data center facilities is managed by Microsoft under their FedRAMP High authorization, which includes visitor escort and monitoring procedures.
{{/if}}

